// v13.0 — MEGA UPDATE
// Features: Homework Tracker, Grade Calculator, SRS Flashcards,
//   Quiz Generator, Citation Generator, Daily Challenges,
//   Seasonal Shop Events, Study Session History, Quizlet CSV Import,
